    "保护期间点击不会执行，进度环结束后再点。仅保护退出时，关闭、最小化和布局操作立即响应。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Clicks are ignored during protection; click again when the progress ring completes. With Quit-only protection, close, minimize, and layout actions respond immediately."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "保护期间点击不会执行，进度环结束后再点。仅保护退出时，关闭、最小化和布局操作立即响应。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
