    "关闭、最小化和全屏会实际作用于这个测试窗口。可随时从设置重新打开。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Close, minimize, and full screen operate on this real test window. Reopen it from Settings at any time."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "关闭、最小化和全屏会实际作用于这个测试窗口。可随时从设置重新打开。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "关闭后暂停红绿灯增强、拖拽贴靠和 Blinker 快捷键；已有配置保留。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Turning this off pauses traffic-light enhancements, snapping, and Blinker shortcuts without changing your saved configuration."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
