    "在系统列表中关闭再开启 Blinker。若仍无效，移除旧条目，再将下方应用拖入列表。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Turn Blinker off and back on in the system list. If it still does not work, remove the old entry and drag in the app below."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "在系统列表中关闭再开启 Blinker。若仍无效，移除旧条目，再将下方应用拖入列表。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "在系统设置中开启 Blinker。列表里没有时，可将下方应用拖入列表。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Allow Blinker in System Settings. If it is missing from the list, try dragging in the app below."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "在系统设置中开启 Blinker。列表里没有时，可将下方应用拖入列表。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "拖动此图标添加 Blinker": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Drag This Icon to Add Blinker"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "拖动此图标添加 Blinker"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "拖入后仍需在系统设置中确认允许。若无法拖入，可在访达中显示应用，再通过列表下方的加号添加。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "You still need to allow access in System Settings after dragging. If dragging does not work, show the app in Finder and add it with the list's plus button."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "拖入后仍需在系统设置中确认允许。若无法拖入，可在访达中显示应用，再通过列表下方的加号添加。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "无法打开系统设置，请前往「隐私与安全性」并选择对应权限。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
