            "state": "translated",
            "value": "未配置"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "系统默认会执行原生按钮动作；选择「无操作」会拦截左键点击。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "System Default performs the native button action. Do Nothing intercepts the left click."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "系统默认会执行原生按钮动作；选择「无操作」会拦截左键点击。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "未配置时按普通左键处理。要在原生按钮上使用长按，也需配置左键动作。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "When not configured, a long press acts as a regular left click. A native button also needs a left-click action configured to use long press."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "未配置时按普通左键处理。要在原生按钮上使用长按，也需配置左键动作。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "未配置时，原生按钮交由系统处理，悬浮按钮不执行操作；「无操作」会拦截该点击。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "When not configured, native clicks pass to macOS and overlay clicks do nothing. Do Nothing intercepts the click."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "未配置时，原生按钮交由系统处理，悬浮按钮不执行操作；「无操作」会拦截该点击。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "点击授权会打开系统设置和可拖拽的应用图标。也可跳过，之后在「设置 → 隐私与权限」中开启。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Authorize opens System Settings and a draggable app icon. You can skip this step and enable permissions later in Settings → Privacy & Permissions."
          }
