    "仅作用于内置屏幕，不录音、不保存屏幕画面。可从菜单暂停；按 Esc 暂停其他应用上方的特效需要辅助功能权限。这不是隐私防护。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Applies only to the built-in display. No audio is recorded and no screen images are saved. Pause from the menu; using Esc to pause effects over other apps requires Accessibility permission. This is not privacy protection."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "仅作用于内置屏幕，不录音、不保存屏幕画面。可从菜单暂停；按 Esc 暂停其他应用上方的特效需要辅助功能权限。这不是隐私防护。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "每次开盖或合盖至少达到设定幅度才会触发，数值越大越能忽略晃动。参考角度和满效果跨度决定效果强度。停稳后按延时清除；开启保持后不自动清除。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Each opening or closing movement must reach this threshold to start the effect. Higher values ignore more shaking. The reference angle and full-effect range determine its strength. Once the lid settles, the effect clears after the delay unless Hold is on."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "每次开盖或合盖至少达到设定幅度才会触发，数值越大越能忽略晃动。参考角度和满效果跨度决定效果强度。停稳后按延时清除；开启保持后不自动清除。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "保持特效直到重新打开": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Hold effect until reopened"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "保持特效直到重新打开"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "减少动态效果已开启，特效暂停": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Paused while Reduce Motion is enabled"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "减少动态效果已开启，特效暂停"
          }
