        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "有 %lld 个窗口未能完成操作。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "显示桌面与恢复": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Show Desktop and Restore"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "显示桌面与恢复"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "收起当前桌面的普通窗口，再次执行只恢复本次收起的窗口。原本最小化和全屏的窗口保持原状；切换桌面后不再恢复上一桌面的窗口。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Minimize normal windows on the current desktop, then run again to restore only those windows. Previously minimized and full-screen windows stay as they are. Switching desktops clears the previous desktop’s restore list."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "收起当前桌面的普通窗口，再次执行只恢复本次收起的窗口。原本最小化和全屏的窗口保持原状；切换桌面后不再恢复上一桌面的窗口。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "启用布局、悬停与桌面快捷键": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Enable Layout, Hover and Desktop Shortcuts"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "启用布局、悬停与桌面快捷键"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "点击组合录制快捷键，Esc 取消，减号清除。此开关同时控制窗口布局、悬停放大和显示桌面快捷键。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Click a shortcut to record it, press Esc to cancel, or use the minus button to clear it. This switch controls layout, hover enlargement and Show Desktop shortcuts."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "点击组合录制快捷键，Esc 取消，减号清除。此开关同时控制窗口布局、悬停放大和显示桌面快捷键。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "桌面": {
      "localizations": {
