    "Wi-Fi 名称需要定位权限来解除系统对网络名称的隐藏；Blinker 不读取位置本身。VPN 行在检测到隧道或系统代理时显示。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The Wi-Fi name needs Location access to un-redact the network name; Blinker never reads your location. The VPN row appears when a tunnel or system proxy is detected."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Wi-Fi 名称需要定位权限来解除系统对网络名称的隐藏；Blinker 不读取位置本身。VPN 行在检测到隧道或系统代理时显示。"
